  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nvb-uy/cdn/main/desc/hysteria/header.png\" alt=\"Hysteria 的标题图\" width=\"1125\" height=\"378\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/prominence\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&color=f2eca1&labelColor=363636&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"205\" height=\"26\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<em><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/SUPPORTS-IRIS, OCULUS, OPTIFINE | 1.7 to 1.21-f2eca1?style=for-the-badge&logo=CurseForge&labelColor=363636&logoColor=white\" width=\"385\" height=\"28\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252felocindev\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ElocinDev-SUPPORT ME-f2eca1?style=for-the-badge&logo=Ko-Fi&labelColor=363636&logoColor=white\" width=\"212\" height=\"27\"></a></em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">一款风格化、氛围感十足的恐怖主题 Iris 着色包，兼具高度可定制性与卓越性能。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">《Insanity Shader》的现代精神续作&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/insanity-shader\" rel=\"nofollow\">Insanity Shader</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">基于 Photon 打造，Hysteria 保留了与 Insanity 极为相似的体验，</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">同时加入了体积云与雾、彩色光照、远山（Distant Horizons）支持等现代特性！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://github.com/nvb-uy/cdn/blob/main/desc/hysteria/familiar_yet_different.png?raw=true\" alt=\"熟悉又不同的外观；焕然一新的 Insanity\" width=\"1125\" height=\"186\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://github.com/nvb-uy/cdn/blob/main/desc/hysteria/comparison_day.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Insanity Shader 与 Hysteria 着色包白天对比\" width=\"1125\" height=\"650\"><img src=\"https://github.com/nvb-uy/cdn/blob/main/desc/hysteria/comparison_night.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Insanity Shader 与 Hysteria 着色包夜晚对比\" width=\"1125\" height=\"650\"><img src=\"https://github.com/nvb-uy/cdn/blob/main/desc/hysteria/comparison_nether.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Insanity Shader 与 Hysteria 着色包下界对比\" width=\"1125\" height=\"650\"><img src=\"https://github.com/nvb-uy/cdn/blob/main/desc/hysteria/comparison_end.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Insanity Shader 与 Hysteria 着色包末地对比\" width=\"1125\" height=\"650\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://github.com/nvb-uy/cdn/blob/main/desc/hysteria/features.png?raw=true\" alt=\"特性\" width=\"1125\" height=\"114\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🧟 <strong>氛围感十足的恐怖外观。</strong> 非常适合恐怖与僵尸类整合包！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">📓 <strong>高度可定制的着色配置。</strong> 在 Photon 的基础上进一步突破限制。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">⛈️ <strong>沉浸式动态天气。</strong> 每一天都独一无二，云朵与色彩随之变幻。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🌫️ <strong>体积雾与云。</strong> 包含地表与远景雾气、动态变化的体积云等更多特性！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🌎 <strong>支持远山（Distant Horizons）。</strong> 实验性功能！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">📝 <strong>用户友好的菜单。</strong> 内置快捷选项菜单，设置直观易懂。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">💻 <strong>兼容大多数现代电脑。</strong> 针对低端显卡进行了深度优化，性能表现甚至超越 Insanity！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🔦 <strong>记得常备火把。</strong> 不仅夜晚漆黑一片，下界与末地的黑暗更是令人绝望！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>🌎 跨版本广泛兼容。</strong> 支持从 1.7.10 起的所有较新版本。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">☀️ <strong>内置彩色光照。</strong> 完美支持 labPBR 资源包。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>由 ElocinDev 用 🖤 倾心制作</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://github.com/nvb-uy/cdn/blob/main/desc/hysteria/credits.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"114\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Sixthsurge</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">制作了 Hysteria 所基于的着色包 Photon</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Capt Tatsu</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px\">制作了 BSL 着色包，并帮助我开启了 Insanity 的开发。没有 Insanity，就不会有 Hysteria！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://github.com/nvb-uy/cdn/blob/main/desc/hysteria/serverbanner.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"201\"></p>",
